  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Explorer 2020 ENGSKO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danida Innovation &amp; Business Explorer (DIBE) offers financial support to Danish companies, including start-ups, that wish to investigate concrete business opportunities contributing to the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris agreement. ENGSKO wants to introduce sustainable milling technology within low-tech markets as well as for humanitarian purposes by 1) Mapping of key pleyers and potential customers/segments within the grain milling sector, 2) Preparation of a marketing plan for entering the Tanzanian market, 3) Identification and agreement with potential Tanzanian partners and/or distributors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and organic food solutions for small farmers, communities, internally displaced people (IDP) and refugess - Tanzania</narrative>
  </description>
